                                                "sense_id": "e448aeb0-8d06-3851-8f1a-b9934896bab3",
                                                "text": "[T]he Converſation (if it may be called ſo) was ſeldom ſuch as could entertain a Lady. It conſiſted chiefly of Hollowing, Singing, Relations of ſporting Adventures, B—d—y, and Abuſe of Women and of the Government."
                                            },
